              "skill_name": "renewal-advisor",
              "file_path": "references/discount-policy.md",
              "content": "# WidgetWare Renewal Discount Policy\n\nPolicy owner: Revenue Operations  \nVersion: 2026.2  \nScope: Renewal discounts for annual recurring revenue (ARR)\n\n## Approval bands\n\nApproval is based on the requested percentage discount from list renewal ARR.\n\n| Requested discount | Required approval |\n| --- | --- |\n| 0%\u20135% | Account Executive |\n| More than 5%\u201310% | Regional Sales Manager |\n| More than 10%\u201315% | VP Sales and Finance Business Partner |\n| More than 15%\u201320% | Chief Revenue Officer and Finance Director |\n| More than 20% | CFO and Chief Revenue Officer; exception memo required |\n\nThe upper boundary in each row is inclusive. For example, exactly 10% requires Regional Sales Manager approval; exactly 15% requires VP Sales and Finance Business Partner approval.\n\n## Additional rules\n\n- Never split a discount across line items to avoid an approval band.\n- Quote arithmetic must use the deterministic calculator when the user asks for dollar discount or net ARR.\n- A discount approval does not approve non-standard legal terms.\n- Do not describe a requested discount as approved until all named approvers have approved it.\n"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "role": "user"
    },
